nt-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Sign in</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-sm font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black rounded-full px-[22px] py-[11px] shadow-[0_4px_18px_rgba(245,166,35,0.20)] hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all\">Start free</a></div><div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"bg-ground text-ink min-h-screen\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"By industry\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/for\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Financial Services\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/for/financial-services\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Marketing for Financial Services\",\"description\":\"Steady, trust-first content and WhatsApp follow-up for financial services brands — trusted by TNV Chits.\",\"serviceType\":\"Marketing service\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/for/financial-services\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nebulaa\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"India\"}}</script><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pt-[140px] pb-[90px] max-w-[900px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[26px] block\">For financial services</span><h1 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[38px] md:text-[60px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-[28px]\" style=\"text-wrap:pretty\">Trust is the product.<br/><span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">Content has to earn it.</span></h1><p class=\"text-[17px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[620px] mb-9\">Chits, lending and financial products sell on trust and clear communication, not hype. Gravity keeps your presence steady and plain-spoken; Pulsar answers &quot;how does this work&quot; the moment someone asks.</p><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"inline-block bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[28px] py-[14px] rounded-full shadow-[0_6px_26px_rgba(245,166,35,0.24)] hover:brightness-105 transition\">Start free trial →</a></section><div class=\"border-y border-rule py-10 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] flex items-center gap-11 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"neb-label  flex-shrink-0\">Working with</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-9 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"font-heading text-lg text-ink-2\">TNV Chits</span></div></div><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[28px] md:text-4xl mb-8\">Sound familiar?</h2><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-surface border border-rule rounded-xl p-[18px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-red-400/70 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Financial products need plain-language content, not generic marketing copy that sounds like everyone else</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-surface border border-rule rounded-xl p-[18px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-red-400/70 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">A new scheme or offer needs to reach past customers and new enquiries without a mass broadcast that reads as spam</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-surface border border-rule rounded-xl p-[18px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-red-400/70 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Every enquiry about terms, tenure or eligibility deserves a fast, accurate answer — not a &quot;someone will call you back&quot;</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-surface border border-rule rounded-xl p-[18px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-red-400/70 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Consistency matters more here than almost anywhere else, and it&#x27;s the first thing that slips when the team gets busy</p></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[28px] md:text-4xl mb-8\">How Nebulaa helps <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">financial services</span></h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start gap-5\"><span class=\"inline-block font-body text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-gold/15 text-gold-text\">Gravity</span><div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-1.5\">Plain-language scheme content</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Gravity writes about your products the way you&#x27;d explain them across the counter — clear, not clever.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start gap-5\"><span class=\"inline-block font-body text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-orange-400/15 text-orange-400\">Pulsar</span><div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-1.5\">Enquiry qualification on WhatsApp</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Pulsar answers questions about eligibility, tenure and terms immediately, and hands over anyone ready to sign up.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start gap-5\"><span class=\"inline-block font-body text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-gold/15 text-gold-text\">Gravity</span><div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-1.5\">Consistent monthly presence</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">A content plan built once a month means nothing goes quiet even when the team is heads-down on operations.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start gap-5\"><span class=\"inline-block font-body text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-orange-400/15 text-orange-400\">Pulsar</span><div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-1.5\">Lead scoring</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Every enquiry is scored on intent, so your team&#x27;s time goes to the people actually ready to move, not window-shoppers.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[130px] pb-[140px] text-center border-t border-rule overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(50% 70% at 50% 100%, rgba(245,166,35,0.10) 0%, rgba(245,166,35,0) 62%)\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[32px] md:text-[50px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-6\">Built for <!-- -->financial services<!-- -->.<br/><span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">Ready in a minute.</span></h2><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[480px] mx-auto mb-9\">Give Nebulaa your website URL. It learns your brand and starts building the content queue — no brief, no onboarding call.</p><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"inline-block bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[30px] py-[15px] rounded-full shadow-[0_6px_26px_rgba(245,166,35,0.24)] hover:brightness-105 transition\">Start your free 7-day trial →</a></div></section></main><footer class=\"relative border-t border-rule pt-[60px] pb-[50px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-[50px] lg:gap-[70px]\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-4\"><div class=\"w-[17px] h-[17px] rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 34% 32%, #FFD48A 0%, #F5A623 46%, #A4650B 100%)\"></div><span class=\"font-heading text-[17px] font-normal text-ink\">Nebulaa</span></div><div class=\"font-body text-[13px] text-muted leading-[1.7]\">Chennai, India<br/><a href=\"mailto:hello@nebulaa.ai\" class=\"hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">hello@nebulaa.ai</a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-[70px] gap-y-[40px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px]\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-1\">Product</span><a href=\"/product\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Overview</a><a href=\"/product/gravity\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Gravity</a><a href=\"/product/pulsar\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] 